VetPress is a block theme for veterinary clinics, groomers and pet daycares, built for the WordPress Site Editor. Its details come from a clinic's own paperwork: kennel cards, collar ID tags, staff badges on lanyards, price tags on strings and a posted fee board. Every section is an editable pattern, and colors, fonts and spacing live in <strong>Styles</strong>, so a change there applies across the whole site. Four style variations give you a cobalt default, a calm clinic, a hot-pink groom room and a dark night shift.